          "english": "Let's take the bus."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "A",
          "hanzi": "巴士要多久？",
          "pinyin": "Bāshì yào duōjiǔ?",
          "english": "How long does the bus take?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "B",
          "hanzi": "要四十分钟。",
          "pinyin": "Yào sìshí fēnzhōng.",
          "english": "Forty minutes."
        },
        {
